<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.2000 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Jan 10		  Jan 9</p>
<p> High			     75.2000		 74.9000</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Open			     75.2000		 74.9000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6000		 75.2000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    9.665		   4.165</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Jan 10		  Jan 9</p>
<p> High			     47.9000		 47.8500</p>
<p> Low				47.9500		 47.8500</p>
<p> Open			     47.9000		 47.8500</p>
<p> Close			    47.9500		 47.8500</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.020		   0.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
